WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.799
<i>An unknown frontier</i>

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>On the map painted by my heart</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>When I open the door, the path goes on</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>I'm kicking up dust as I</i>
<i>start running to your town</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Along a route where earth and sky meet</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Riding the rushing southern wind</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Slicing through the wind</i>
<i>dyed blue by the sky</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>I'm rushing out with my whole heart</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Shooting past the midday moon</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Towards a world different</i>
<i>from what we've known before</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:36.096
<i>I will keep on running through to the end</i>

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>However far</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Just like that wind</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Just like that wind</i>

00:02:17.262 --> 00:02:20.807
"News regarding the situation
in Hong Kong is..."

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:56.301
"Her Problem"

00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:05.811
What's wrong, Kana-<i>chan</i>?

00:03:05.811 --> 00:03:07.938
Oh, it's you, Kyoko.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.232
Kana-<i>chan</i>?

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.571
Are you feeling sick?

00:03:15.571 --> 00:03:18.240
Do you want me to go with you
to the nurse's office?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.659
No, I'm fine.

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:26.248
Kaname Chidori from class 2-4.

00:03:26.248 --> 00:03:28.292
Please come to the faculty room.

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:29.293
To repeat...

00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:34.756
It looks like Sagara
sent this to my office.

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:38.260
Um, try not to be shocked
when you hear this, okay?

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.096
Miss Chidori, are you okay?
Your face looks pale.

00:03:41.096 --> 00:03:42.723
I'm fine.

00:03:42.723 --> 00:03:45.934
Anyway, what was in the envelope?

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:48.937
A withdrawal notice.

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:51.940
Yes, he's been absent a lot lately,

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.569
but I never thought he would withdraw
all of a sudden without discussing it.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:57.946
I can't get him on the phone, either.

00:03:57.946 --> 00:04:00.824
I just don't know what to do.

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:02.993
And so, Miss Chidori...

00:04:02.993 --> 00:04:03.744
Yes?

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:05.621
Do you have any idea
what's going on here?

00:04:05.621 --> 00:04:06.663
No.

00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:07.372
But...

00:04:07.372 --> 00:04:09.208
I don't know.

00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:10.834
Are you two fighting
again or something?

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:12.503
No.

00:04:14.463 --> 00:04:17.007
If I don't hear anything
from him by tomorrow,

00:04:17.007 --> 00:04:21.428
I'll have to give this
to the principal for acceptance.

00:04:21.428 --> 00:04:24.014
Then, he'll be withdrawn?

00:04:33.941 --> 00:04:35.400
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.277
<i>He's not here anymore.</i>

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:39.363
<i>I don't know what happened,</i>

00:04:39.363 --> 00:04:43.992
<i>but even if someone comes after you,</i>
<i>he's not going to save you.</i>

00:04:43.992 --> 00:04:46.870
<i>There's no doubt</i>
<i>I'm being watched.</i>

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.956
<i>I have to think of a counter-plan.</i>

00:04:48.956 --> 00:04:52.334
<i>I can't get Ms. Kagurazaka or Kyoko</i>
<i>and the others involved no matter what.</i>

00:04:52.334 --> 00:04:53.710
<i>Pull yourself together, Kaname!</i>

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:57.881
<i>You're not some princess in the top</i>
<i>of a tower who can't do anything but sigh.</i>

00:04:57.881 --> 00:04:59.424
<i>First, I need information.</i>

00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:02.594
<i>I have to figure out exactly</i>
<i>what's going on around me!</i>

00:05:55.439 --> 00:05:58.108
Maybe I'm just imagining
things after all.

00:05:58.442 --> 00:05:59.818
"Bugging - Spy Photos"

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.571
"Our staff of specialists
will eliminate your worries!"

00:06:11.455 --> 00:06:13.582
Hey, are you alone?

00:06:13.582 --> 00:06:17.920
Would you like to go get something
good to eat? It'll be my treat.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.588
I'm not hungry.

00:06:19.588 --> 00:06:22.257
Aww, don't say that.

00:06:22.257 --> 00:06:25.969
Then why don't we go for drinks
or something? I know a good place.

00:06:25.969 --> 00:06:30.140
Listen, I'm in the middle
of something right now.

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.850
What?

00:06:33.477 --> 00:06:35.938
Mister, would you like
to go to a hotel with me?

00:06:40.025 --> 00:06:43.946
Come on, let's hurry up
and go in, Mizuki. It's raining.

00:06:43.946 --> 00:06:45.948
Hold on a minute.

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:50.452
Okay, let's go in.

00:06:50.452 --> 00:06:53.664
All right, Mizuki.
I'm gonna hustle!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.127
Which room do you want?

00:06:59.127 --> 00:07:00.754
Room 202.

00:07:00.754 --> 00:07:03.215
Huh? But there are better rooms.

00:07:03.215 --> 00:07:05.467
And it looks small.

00:07:05.467 --> 00:07:06.468
Then I'm leaving.

00:07:06.468 --> 00:07:09.596
Just kidding!
Sorry, sorry, that room's fine.

00:07:14.977 --> 00:07:16.979
Mizuki.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:20.357
W-Wait a minute!

00:07:20.357 --> 00:07:22.192
Let me explain the situation!

00:07:22.192 --> 00:07:23.694
You don't mind taking
a bath later, do you?

00:07:23.694 --> 00:07:25.487
Hold on!
Listen to me!

00:07:25.487 --> 00:07:27.281
You're so cute, Mizuki.

00:07:29.032 --> 00:07:31.493
Ah, the smell
of a high school girl!

00:07:32.494 --> 00:07:33.954
Good grief.

00:07:36.331 --> 00:07:39.626
I wonder which one of us
is the victim in this situation.

00:08:01.648 --> 00:08:04.860
I'm sure these are fine.

00:08:16.205 --> 00:08:17.664
I guess I'll go with this one.

00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:21.502
Good to go!

00:09:38.245 --> 00:09:40.330
<i>This is it.</i>

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.584
<i>You can see the entire</i>
<i>area from up there.</i>

00:09:48.005 --> 00:09:50.007
<i>If there is someone,</i>

00:09:50.007 --> 00:09:52.176
<i>I'm sure he's there...</i>

00:10:04.062 --> 00:10:05.022
<i>There he is!</i>

00:10:44.686 --> 00:10:48.023
Don't move. I have a weapon
pointed right at you.

00:10:48.023 --> 00:10:51.652
Put your hands up
and turn around.

00:10:51.652 --> 00:10:55.739
What? You noticed the transmitter?

00:10:55.739 --> 00:10:59.826
You have some business with me,
right? That's why I came.

00:10:59.826 --> 00:11:04.248
And so you went into a hotel like that
with a guy you've never met?

00:11:04.248 --> 00:11:07.417
I guess I underestimated you a bit.

00:11:07.417 --> 00:11:09.795
You must have a gun, right?

00:11:09.795 --> 00:11:12.422
Take it out slowly
and toss it at your feet.

00:11:12.422 --> 00:11:17.010
I am from Mithril.
I won't attack you.

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:20.806
You don't say!
I can't trust you.

00:11:20.806 --> 00:11:22.766
Don't get carried away.

00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:25.352
I might not be able to kill you,

00:11:25.352 --> 00:11:29.773
but I<i> can </i>stop that
smart-ass mouth of yours.

00:11:29.773 --> 00:11:31.441
There's something worse
you should be worried about.

00:11:31.441 --> 00:11:34.945
These past few days, I've sensed
someone else pursuing you...

00:11:34.945 --> 00:11:37.781
I told you to throw down your gun,
didn't I? Damn asshole!

00:11:48.292 --> 00:11:51.211
Kaname Chidori, correct?

00:12:18.864 --> 00:12:20.741
I'm alive.

00:13:36.525 --> 00:13:38.569
<i>Will it work correctly?</i>
<i>Will it hit?</i>

00:13:38.569 --> 00:13:41.113
<i>Could this be a trap?</i>
<i>Does she know I'm up here?</i>

00:13:41.113 --> 00:13:42.573
<i>Does she have some sort of trick</i>
<i>up her sleeve or something?</i>

00:13:42.573 --> 00:13:45.325
<i>Am I going to be killed?</i>
<i>Should I beg for my life?</i>

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:46.827
<i>She's a pro.</i>

00:13:46.827 --> 00:13:47.828
<i>--I can't win. There's no way I can win.</i>

00:13:47.828 --> 00:13:48.412
--Chidori, you cannot afford to have mercy in such a situation.
<i>--I can't win. There's no way I can win.</i>

00:13:48.412 --> 00:13:51.582
--Chidori, you cannot afford to have mercy in such a situation.
<i>--There's no way. There's just no way.</i>

00:13:51.582 --> 00:13:54.501
Only someone third-rate would
lick his lips in front of the prey.

00:14:18.984 --> 00:14:21.403
It seems like you've won.

00:14:22.571 --> 00:14:27.910
I think there are two kinds
of women in this world.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.579
Those that look good in the rain,
and those that don't.

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:33.707
You are most definitely
the first kind.

00:14:33.707 --> 00:14:37.878
Anyone would think the same thing
if they saw you right now.

00:14:37.878 --> 00:14:40.547
Is that some sort of sarcasm?

00:14:40.547 --> 00:14:42.341
I'm offended.

00:14:42.341 --> 00:14:45.636
It was intended to be
the ultimate compliment.

00:14:45.636 --> 00:14:48.514
Who are you?

00:14:48.514 --> 00:14:52.851
I am the same as you.
I came to save you.

00:14:52.851 --> 00:14:56.772
Well, I wish I could say that,
but that's not actually it.

00:14:56.772 --> 00:14:59.149
Idly watching how your fight
turned out, or lending you a hand-

00:14:59.149 --> 00:15:01.818
either would have been fine with me.

00:15:01.818 --> 00:15:04.947
Although the results may have
been the same either way.

00:15:04.947 --> 00:15:06.907
The way you talk pisses me off.

00:15:06.907 --> 00:15:08.659
Are you incapable of giving
a straight answer?

00:15:08.659 --> 00:15:11.703
I don't think very highly of being
<i>too </i>straightforward, either.

00:15:11.703 --> 00:15:15.040
But that might just be your allure.

00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:18.460
That hair...

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.004
Don't tell me you're Tessa's...

00:15:21.004 --> 00:15:23.257
Get up, Yu Lan.

00:15:23.257 --> 00:15:26.468
You're already awake, aren't you?

00:15:26.468 --> 00:15:29.054
Mr. Silver.
You were watching?

00:15:29.054 --> 00:15:34.184
You're no match for her.
You should give up.

00:15:34.184 --> 00:15:36.687
You have ignored the
organization's intentions,

00:15:36.687 --> 00:15:38.647
but I will come to your defense for it.

00:15:38.647 --> 00:15:42.526
I want you to reason with your sister,
who's running wild in Hong Kong.

00:15:42.526 --> 00:15:44.945
Do you think we will obey?

00:15:44.945 --> 00:15:47.197
Revenge is so empty.

00:15:47.197 --> 00:15:49.199
It's something Sensei wanted.

00:15:49.199 --> 00:15:50.993
As long as I'm still alive,

00:15:50.993 --> 00:15:54.204
I will keep trying to kill her.

00:15:54.204 --> 00:15:57.666
Then this is goodbye, Yu Lan.

00:15:57.666 --> 00:16:00.460
You are the one who's going
to die, Leonard Testarossa!

00:16:02.212 --> 00:16:03.964
It's useless.

00:16:14.558 --> 00:16:16.101
What are your orders, sir?

00:16:16.101 --> 00:16:18.812
Response A-1.
And be certain of it.

00:16:18.812 --> 00:16:20.480
Roger.

00:16:40.501 --> 00:16:42.169
Response A-1 complete.

00:16:42.169 --> 00:16:44.421
The designated threat
has been completely silenced.

00:16:44.421 --> 00:16:46.256
Thank you. Stand by.

00:16:46.256 --> 00:16:47.341
Roger.

00:16:48.592 --> 00:16:51.553
Plan 1211, Alastor.

00:16:51.553 --> 00:16:55.474
I guess you could say it's
the world's smallest Arm Slave.

00:16:55.474 --> 00:16:57.768
I suppose you already
know by this point,

00:16:57.768 --> 00:17:00.521
but it is difficult to make
an AS which is autonomous.

00:17:00.521 --> 00:17:03.273
Miniaturizing the power source,
control system and other components

00:17:03.273 --> 00:17:05.275
took quite a bit of work as well.

00:17:05.275 --> 00:17:09.738
What just happened was my
real purpose for being here.

00:17:09.738 --> 00:17:11.698
I ended up showing you
something unpleasant.

00:17:11.698 --> 00:17:15.452
I-I don't understand
what's going on. But...

00:17:15.452 --> 00:17:16.286
But?

00:17:16.286 --> 00:17:18.539
There was no reason to kill her.

00:17:18.539 --> 00:17:21.458
I wasn't the one
who wanted this result.

00:17:21.458 --> 00:17:22.668
It was she herself.

00:17:22.668 --> 00:17:23.502
But...

00:17:23.502 --> 00:17:28.048
Besides, I haven't killed as many
people as your boyfriend has.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.760
That guy...

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:35.681
He's been fighting in wars
ever since he was a kid!

00:17:35.681 --> 00:17:37.432
He had no other choice!

00:17:37.432 --> 00:17:39.810
And besides, his enemies
were all bad people.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:43.814
And he helps people who aren't involved,
and people who are weaker than him!

00:17:43.814 --> 00:17:46.775
And he doesn't enjoy
that kind of thing at all!

00:17:46.775 --> 00:17:50.779
Anyway, he's nothing like this!

00:17:50.779 --> 00:17:53.198
He doesn't do things like this!

00:17:53.198 --> 00:17:57.160
You don't seriously believe
that logic, do you?

00:17:58.495 --> 00:18:01.164
The essence of our actions is the same.

00:18:01.164 --> 00:18:04.334
And yet I'm the only one you criticize.

00:18:04.334 --> 00:18:06.628
You're very much on his side, aren't you?

00:18:06.628 --> 00:18:07.838
Not at all.

00:18:07.838 --> 00:18:09.131
You love him.

00:18:09.131 --> 00:18:10.132
No I don't.

00:18:10.132 --> 00:18:11.049
Oh, really?

00:18:11.049 --> 00:18:12.092
Yes, really!

00:18:12.092 --> 00:18:13.844
Look at me.

00:18:29.526 --> 00:18:31.778
It's all right. Stand by.

00:18:35.032 --> 00:18:36.283
What did you do that for?

00:18:36.283 --> 00:18:39.244
It was a wake-up kiss, I suppose.

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:41.371
Because I've fallen in love with you.

00:18:41.371 --> 00:18:43.874
Well, I hate you. I'm gonna puke!

00:18:43.874 --> 00:18:46.168
That's what I like about you.

00:18:46.168 --> 00:18:48.212
You seem fragile, but you're ferocious.

00:18:48.212 --> 00:18:50.255
You seem vulgar, but you're noble.

00:18:50.255 --> 00:18:52.674
You're slippery, like water.

00:18:52.674 --> 00:18:53.800
Shut up!

00:18:56.303 --> 00:19:01.225
I had better retreat
before you try to kill me.

00:19:01.225 --> 00:19:03.227
Wait a minute!

00:19:04.478 --> 00:19:05.395
What?

00:19:05.395 --> 00:19:09.566
I had business with him.
Leave him here.

00:19:09.566 --> 00:19:12.945
Do I have a reason
to listen to that request?

00:19:12.945 --> 00:19:17.366
Yes, you do.
I'll forgive what you did to me.

00:19:17.366 --> 00:19:19.910
So leave him.

00:19:21.745 --> 00:19:23.247
Drop him.

00:19:23.247 --> 00:19:24.873
Roger.

00:19:27.042 --> 00:19:30.045
Just one thing
before I say goodbye.

00:19:30.045 --> 00:19:35.175
I really did fall in love with you,
so I want you to believe that.

00:19:35.175 --> 00:19:37.594
Very well then,
I'll see you again sometime.

00:19:46.728 --> 00:19:48.564
Can you move? Are you hurt?

00:19:48.564 --> 00:19:53.527
I don't know. That guy
injected me with something.

00:19:53.527 --> 00:19:55.279
Would you like me to help you?

00:19:55.279 --> 00:19:58.782
No thank you. Even I have pride.

00:19:58.782 --> 00:20:01.952
This failure, this pitiful state I'm in...

00:20:01.952 --> 00:20:03.954
I would've been better off dead.

00:20:04.955 --> 00:20:06.832
I see.

00:20:27.895 --> 00:20:30.731
Sousuke...

00:20:30.731 --> 00:20:32.482
Why...

00:20:32.482 --> 00:20:35.319
Why aren't you here?

00:20:35.319 --> 00:20:38.322
It turned out like this
because you weren't here.

00:20:43.785 --> 00:20:47.956
I hate this.

00:20:47.956 --> 00:20:51.001
Be right next to me...

00:20:51.001 --> 00:20:53.378
Say "It's not a problem."

00:20:53.378 --> 00:20:55.380
Sousuke...

00:21:54.439 --> 00:21:58.735
You said you would've been
better off dead, right?

00:22:01.405 --> 00:22:04.658
How about putting up
a little more resistance?

00:22:04.658 --> 00:22:06.702
I will.

00:22:06.702 --> 00:22:10.038
Now, and forever.

00:22:27.764 --> 00:22:29.516
<i>I'm sure you're still looking</i>

00:22:29.516 --> 00:22:33.312
<i>Straight ahead to tomorrow</i>

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:39.193
<i>Just like you always have</i>

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:44.907
<i>Just like the sunflowers</i>

00:22:44.907 --> 00:22:51.663
<i>That bloomed on that windy hill</i>

00:22:53.582 --> 00:22:59.505
<i>No matter how far apart we are</i>

00:22:59.505 --> 00:23:05.511
<i>I pray that my singing will reach you</i>

00:23:05.511 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>On nights when the tears never seem to stop</i>

00:23:11.558 --> 00:23:14.895
<i>I want to be the moon</i>

00:23:14.895 --> 00:23:17.898
<i>That shines through your window</i>

00:23:17.898 --> 00:23:25.948
<i>Because I believe we will meet again</i>

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:31.870
<i>No matter what</i>

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:46.677
"Next Episode"

00:23:46.677 --> 00:23:49.847
<i>Why do I fight? I don't know.</i>

00:23:49.847 --> 00:23:52.516
<i>My heart is withering,</i>
<i>and my strength is disappearing.</i>

00:23:52.516 --> 00:23:57.187
<i>I had a new mission ahead of me,</i>
<i>but I couldn't see anything anymore.</i>

00:23:57.187 --> 00:23:59.815
<i>Next time: "Hong Kong in Two."</i>

00:23:59.815 --> 00:24:04.672
<i>And the scene is a city burning with chaos.</i>
